WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
The number and location have been checked.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,840
The mutants were recovered

3
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,000
Ordinary corpses do not need to be loaded into trucks

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,800
What exactly does the research center want with these?

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,880
The above only says that it is used for Jing nuclear research and does not touch the isolation zone.

6
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,480
No one can save you except infection

7
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,140
Humans cannot gain abilities by swallowing thorn cores

8
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:19,380
But the base has found other uses

9
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,240
from now on

10
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,940
Jing Core is no longer just my evolutionary resource

11
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,640
You only have the ability to pick locks

12
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,960
I can't find another one

13
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,640
All three of us are going to starve to death.

14
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,040
The corridor is full of zombies

15
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:37,440
If you go out, you will die.

16
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,990
Then just wait to die?
